cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite both this repository and the TLM:UAV dataset."
title: "TLM-UAV Quantum Anomaly Detection: Reproducible Benchmark of Classical, Quantum, and Hybrid Detectors on the TLM:UAV Telemetry Dataset"
abstract: >
  Code, figures, and aggregated experimental results for the study of quantum
  machine learning applied to UAV cyber-physical anomaly detection on the
  TLM:UAV dataset, under a leakage-free, group-aware temporal protocol (B2)
  with explicit contextual-proxy auditing.
type: software
